# Loaded by `wxt build --mode staging` (mode=staging) — the testing deploy.
# Unlike bracemark-web's staging (which needs Nx `envFile`), wxt selects this file
# natively from `--mode staging`. WXT_PUBLIC_* vars are baked into the bundle, so
# nothing secret belongs here.
# Staging is its OWN registrable domain (dryrunbase.com), not a subdomain of
# bracemark.com — see docs/hosting.md, _why staging is a separate domain_.
# `utils/web-app-url.ts` hard-codes the matching `app.` host for the same mode.
WXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.dryrunbase.com
